  "result": "Perfect! All **297 tests pass** (15 late fee tests added).\n\n**Updated Module: `src/reports.js`**\n- Added `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` function that:\n  - Calculates 0.04% late charge per day overdue on the amount still due\n  - Returns 0 if invoice is not yet overdue (dueDate >= asOf)\n  - Formula: `balance * daysOverdue * 0.0004`\n  - Rounds result to cents (integer)\n  - Uses daysBetween to count days from dueDate to asOf\n  - Uses balanceDue for the outstanding balance\n\n**New Tests: `test/reports.test.js`** (15 late fee test cases)\n- No fee for invoices not yet due\n- No fee for invoices on due date\n- No fee for fully paid invoices\n- Correct fee for 1 day overdue\n- Correct fee for 10 days overdue\n- Fee increases linearly with days overdue\n- Correct fee for partially paid invoices\n- Fee proportional to balance\n- Rounding to integer cents\n- Verification of 0.04% rate (0.0004 multiplier)\n- Fee with large balance and many days\n- Draft invoice handling\n- Zero balance = zero fee\n- Comparison of fee amounts for different dates\n\nLate fees accrue on outstanding balances at 0.04% per day, useful for customer statements and collections.",
